71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-fJihwQq7hAQ7kNvwETmgje&_nc_oc=Adpic0gL2dE7IXqidUx3ghDnFZu1wCgcQzUl3sTI-gahqEBnUnuRQnDGqWHBQtaMNEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKpSGPzmcis9XZyTSJu0MYm05pSeJi7gdpMwIKstuou2A&oe=6A9C14B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bMTFyLpiIlgQ7kNvwHLencc&_nc_oc=Ado6-Yofwi8pPf9PLx-_HhcBfRAuassBa_HqvJGEYvrATTjEGfh_7zO2aoYEY7NiXEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL77lapVsvBEGmH6Xf2iHrcvrJkGa1JZxtSywl7H56eKw&oe=6A9C2793"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EjdVlIysWPwQ7kNvwEsrZtB&_nc_oc=Adoj0QYhVSG_IPZEWbU9JMwhzgKl3AumgHYbLXWExve8SfLn_HY7B-4hzNavFqn9q3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKdlpjPdquEvpwedfbiTwn4axi2DZ1nNPIwBr6LjvqH7Q&oe=6A9C25DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: